      "rationale": "The span explicitly requires preserving genuine processing delays in comparisons between related workflow stages."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C021_SIGNAL",
    "value": "Compare workflow stages only where folder identities or histories establish their relationship. A matching alignment respects independent dates and additional histories; matches requiring unexplained changes in processing delays indicate unresolved chronology. Reporting-date shifts do not establish processing time.",
    "scope": "Prospective comparison of related workflow records, assuming the described alignment signal occurs; genuine workflow delays remain distinct from reporting-date uncertainty.",
